[{"title":"遣兴三首 其一","author":"文同","text":"恻恻抱伊郁，试此登嶕峣。\n阴风吹繁云，黯黯蒙泰霄。\n关河眇无际，节物何萧萧。\n过雁安所之，惊哀翻泬寥。\n幽怀漭如失，随此群草凋。\n嗟予生胡为，迹玷明盛朝。\n服职讵云补，赧然缀群寮。\n感此四序迁，一昏复一朝。\n寒霜入两鬓，渐积不肯消。\n良辰乖所遇，慨叹心魂飘。\n贱禀迂且介，于时信无庸。\n欲适阂所之，此道当何从。\n富贵谅非有，僻陋知可容。\n岂不愧上恩，耗此釜与钟。\n昨归得此州，满眼皆乱峰。\n事物固琐碎，敢兹任顽慵。\n报国祇自明，惟神谍其胸。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":7290,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"遣兴效乐天","author":"文同","text":"君莫学杨虞卿奉李宗闵，宗闵权势岂能久。\n君莫学刘栖楚附李逢吉，逢吉禄位宁长守。\n虽然一时身暂好，其奈千古名常丑。\n丈夫读书要知道，所信不笃被其诱。\n大张富贵作罗网，愚者纷纷以身就。\n左缠右绕不可脱，诛窜还当逐其后。\n君不见虞卿须遇李固言，君不见栖楚终遭韦处厚。\n一朝摧折灵气尽，龙如蛇兮虎如狗。\n劝君圣贤术内好潜心，劝君邪佞党中休入手。\n岂不知潞州处士田佐时，唤与美官嫌不受。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":7291,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"鄠上怀古","author":"文同","text":"未晓南山去，从禽夜不归。\n凡行多少地，十二所更衣。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":7292,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"鉴崖","author":"文同","text":"层崖瑩青瑶，泠滑不可扪。\n秋光发净照，林影摇晴暾。\n飞瀑涤吟肺，垂萝清饮魂。\n惟忧渍愁霖，碎藓来相痕。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":7293,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"鼓子","author":"文同","text":"柔条长百尺，秀萼包千叶。\n不惜作高架，为君相引接。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":7294,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"嘉川","author":"文同","text":"嘉川之西过新栈，几里朱栏绕青壁。\n我行落月尚在水，水影照人襟袖白。\n繁英杂缀修蔓上，绿锦缬带垂百尺。\n清香满马去未休，赖尔春风慰行客。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":7295,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"漫郎亭","author":"文同","text":"凿城为洞深且长，沿壕开径闲复荒。\n有亭如许入蒙密，谁比次山称漫郎。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":7296,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"翡翠","author":"文同","text":"清晨有珍禽，翩翩下鱼梁。\n其形不盈握，毛羽鲜且光。\n天人裁碧霞，为尔缝衣裳。\n晶荧炫我目，非世之青黄。\n爱之坐良久，常恐瞥尔翔。\n忽然投清漪，得食如针铓。\n如是者三四，厌饫已一肮。\n既饱且自嬉，翻身度回塘。\n飞鸣逐佳匹，相和音琅琅。\n是时凫与雁，狼藉岛屿旁。\n满腹酿腥秽，纷纷晒晴阳。\n鹙鸧最粗恶，嘴大脚胫长。\n入水捕蛇鳝，淤泥亦衔将。\n想其见尔时，一啄亦尔伤。\n其心肯谓尔，被体凝华章。\n劝尔慎所止，好丑难同乡。\n清溪多纤鲜，亦足充尔肠。\n江海深且阔，所获未可量。\n尔当事澡刷，帝囿参鸾凰。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":7297,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"静中吟","author":"文同","text":"客去复掩户，高松下清阴。\n微风动其间，对语双珍禽。\n幽人独凭几，听此古意深。\n起来南窗下，被以朱弦琴。\n弹之代佳话，俚耳谁知音。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":7298,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"嘲中条","author":"文同","text":"荆山赴太华，百万如走驼。\n嘴尾不相殊，前后翻海波。\n既至拥而蹲，仰首争列罗。\n太华势愈尊，引手欲下摩。\n中条从北来，亦愿依巍峨。\n岂知队伍弱，只类马与骡。\n奔腾气力尽，群伏饮大河。\n饮已只南望，岌然将奈何。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":7299,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"墨君堂","author":"文同","text":"嗜竹种复画，浑如王掾居。\n高堂倚空岩，素壁交扶疏。\n山影覆秋静，月色澄夜虚。\n萧爽只自适，谁能爱吾庐。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":7300,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"墨君堂晚晴凭栏","author":"文同","text":"墨君堂中看新霁，十里平林铺净绿。\n青烟一去抹远岸，白鸟双来立乔木。\n戴胜入园蚕已老，栗留过陇麦将熟。\n坐待月破东岭云，自取帘钩更高轴。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":7301,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题东岩隐者壁","author":"文同","text":"青峰丛丛拥危壑，绿树团团扶曲阁。\n幽人睡起漱寒泉，坐看一林山雨落。\n岩前火气杂芝朮，涧下苔痕乱猿鹤。\n自怜尘土满衣衫，欲解从君今尚莫。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":7302,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题李处士月轩","author":"文同","text":"圆蟾喷金波，万里洒清滴。\n幽轩得虚敞，皓彩溢素壁。\n绳床有高隐，苦调起岑寂。\n盈襟纳孤光，静与爽气敌。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":7303,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"薄命女","author":"文同","text":"夭夭东邻姝，艳色如春柔。\n去嫁不得偶，罗衣空自羞。\n轻埃掩菱花，不分铅华休。\n回首视庸奴，寂寞还卷收。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":7304,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赠日新禅师","author":"文同","text":"嶕峣祝融峰，䆗窱懒瓒岩。\n师也西南人，尝居彼巉巉。\n十年不下山，烟云烂衣衫。\n借问尔何为，法味见愈馋。\n妄萌将轧然，即以慧刃芟。\n既久辟门户，不须更封缄。\n龙神护水瓶，鬼物扶经函。\n叠足坐苍石，放身依古杉。\n一日望剑门，归心瞥如帆。\n过我画戟前，清晨投短衔。\n欣然揖师坐，未语已不凡。\n再勘自不破，谁敢分酸咸。\n大朴本无痕，巧者强削劖。\n师如捉龟拂，定不空喃喃。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":7305,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赠城南观音院庵主广师","author":"文同","text":"簿领日婴薄，纷然汩幽襟。\n驾言出城南，聊欲清此心。\n平冈见净刹，石径郁以深。\n中有苦空人，峭健奇骨森。\n十年一庵下，形迹了莫寻。\n兀如拥败褐，口吐众妙音。\n时下寂照堂，声绝响亦沈。\n默矣盖自得，其谁知少林。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":7306,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"霜柏亭试墨","author":"文同","text":"山风吹早晴，裌服觉微凛。\n烟云有佳尚，竹石得幽禀。\n闲窗覆旧局，晚阁试新品。\n几欲赋郊居，奇词未如沈。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":7307,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"霹雳","author":"文同","text":"君不见，前时忽疑天地坼，万里一声晴霹雳。\n彼某氏者尔何人，敢自欺诬被诛磔。\n子烂华容神火燎，父碎梓潼灵䃸劈。\n惟震与曜今晓然，谁对君亲肆奸逆。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":7308,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"灙泉亭","author":"文同","text":"竹列苍戟枝干稠，亭开翠幄窗户幽。\n下分灙水入渠口，正坐小榻临清流。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":7309,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"郡斋水阁闲书 车轩","author":"文同","text":"平湖静处朱阁，垂柳深中画桥。\n隐几香烟露湿，投竿衣带风飘。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":7310,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"郡斋水阁闲书 再赠鹭鸶","author":"文同","text":"颈若琼钩浅曲，股如碧管深翘。\n湖上水禽无数，其谁似汝风标。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":7311,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"郡斋水阁闲书 青鹳","author":"文同","text":"常恶静时凫鹜，不惊饱处虾鱼。\n与吾闲正相似，问尔乐复何如。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":7312,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"郡斋水阁闲书 自咏","author":"文同","text":"看画亭中默坐，吟诗岸上微行。\n人谓偷闲太守，自呼窃禄先生。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":7313,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"郡斋水阁闲书 自悟","author":"文同","text":"自悟空王理胜，因知辩士辞穷。\n但了一忘六解，休论四异三同。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":7314,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"郡斋水阁闲书 报国","author":"文同","text":"报国无忘竭节，居官勿用论功。\n莫问咥咥趋乐，不烦咄咄书空。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":7315,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"郡斋水阁闲书 闲书","author":"文同","text":"逐出堪羞子溥，归来可重渊明。\n试问七松处士，何如五柳先生。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":7316,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"郡斋水阁闲书 凭几","author":"文同","text":"列传日逢佳士，群书时得微言。\n自对古人凭几，不烦俗客登门。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":7317,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"郡斋水阁闲书 采莲","author":"文同","text":"岸帻客来桥上，溅裙人在湖中。\n桂楫兰桡甚处，莲花荷叶无穷。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":7318,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"郡斋水阁闲书 亭馆","author":"文同","text":"亭馆翛翛度日，园林寂寂经春。\n且遮新笋誇客，莫扫残花闷人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":7319,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"郡斋水阁闲书 独坐","author":"文同","text":"不报门前宾客，已收案上文书。\n独坐水边林下，宛如故里闲居。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":7320,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"郡斋水阁闲书 相如","author":"文同","text":"相如何必称病，靖节奚须去官。\n就下其谁不许，如愚是处皆安。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":7321,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"郡斋水阁闲书 闻道","author":"文同","text":"闻道幸非曲士，读书甘作陈人。\n为文自怪逆俗，好画谁知入神。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":7322,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"郡斋水阁闲书 流水","author":"文同","text":"四首秦僧绝论，一篇楚客离骚。\n读罢却弹流水，先生此兴尤高。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":7323,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"郡斋水阁闲书 莲子","author":"文同","text":"绿实填房未满，黄茸绕壳方开。\n为问因谁劝酒，一时齐侧金杯。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":7324,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"郡斋水阁闲书 衰后","author":"文同","text":"衰后常亲药饵，忧来颇忆林泉。\n身坐谢庄小阁，心游沈约东田。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":7325,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"郡斋水阁闲书 推琴","author":"文同","text":"点点新萍帖水，濛濛乱絮萦风。\n尽日推琴默坐，有人池上亭中。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":7326,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"郡斋水阁闲书 彭泽","author":"文同","text":"彭泽先生未去，武陵太守常贫。\n上官幸且容己，下鬼休来笑人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":7327,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"郡斋水阁闲书 湖上","author":"文同","text":"湖上双禽泛泛，桥边细柳垂垂。\n日午亭中无事，使君来此吟诗。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":7328,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"郡斋水阁闲书 湖桥","author":"文同","text":"湖桥北颊花坞，水阁西头竹村。\n霏霏薄雾红暖，漠漠轻烟翠昏。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":7329,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"郡斋水阁闲书 翡翠","author":"文同","text":"见诸长喙须避，得少纤鳞便飞。\n为报休来近岸，有人爱汝毛衣。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":7330,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"郡斋水阁闲书 静观","author":"文同","text":"十许纹鱼弄水，一双花鸭眠沙。\n静观只恐惊去，无语凭栏日斜。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":7331,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"郡斋水阁闲书 鹭鸶","author":"文同","text":"避雨竹间点点，迎风柳下翻翻。\n静依寒蓼如画，独立晴沙可怜。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":7332,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"重送 其二","author":"文同","text":"燕尾归艎正稳，鸭头春水方深。\n不得同摇楚棹，与君齐到山阴。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":7333,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"步月","author":"文同","text":"掩卷下中庭，月色浩如水。\n秋气凉满襟，松阴密铺地。\n百虫催夜去，一雁领寒起。\n静念忘世纷，谁同此佳味。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":7334,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送棋僧惟照","author":"文同","text":"学成九章开方诀，诵得一行乘除诗。\n自然天性晓绝艺，可敌国手应吾师。\n窗前横榻拥炉处，门外大雪压屋时。\n独翻旧局辨错著，冷笑古人心许谁。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":7335,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其四","author":"文同","text":"来观古柏丹渊客。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":7336,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其二","author":"文同","text":"拟将一段鹅溪绢，扫取寒梢万丈长。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":7337,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其一","author":"文同","text":"北客若来休问事，西湖虽好莫吟诗。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":7338,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"织妇怨","author":"文同","text":"掷梭两手倦，踏籋双足趼。\n三日不住织，一疋才可剪。\n织处畏风日，剪时谨刀尺。\n皆言边幅好，自爱经纬密。\n昨朝持入库，何事监官怒。\n大字雕印文，浓和油墨污。\n父母抱归舍，抛向中门下。\n相看各无语，泪迸若倾泻。\n质钱解衣服，买丝添上轴。\n不敢辄下机，连宵停火烛。\n当须了租赋，岂暇恤襦裤。\n前知寒切骨，甘心肩骭露。\n里胥踞门限，叫骂嗔纳晚。\n安得织妇心，变作监官眼。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":7339,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"龙多山","author":"文师敬","text":"我家龙多西，出门山在目。\n杖履三十里，兄弟穿云宿。\n山上有顷田，岩洞多重复。\n石囤如内空，可容万亿斛。\n奇古一仙台，清绝三梵屋。\n千岁大夫松，万竿君子竹。\n四时风飕飕，多寒而少燠。\n天低星日近，举首心自肃。\n不敢高声呼，恐帝谓予黩。\n转盼四方宽，万山皆俯伏。\n幽人来避世，松柏可充腹。\n何劳苦煎炮，自有云蒸熟。\n朝易暮楞严，随意伴幽独。\n天下真乐在，安用名利逐。\n我亦知此乐，倚门望良速。\n入山未要深，且归问寝餗。\n男儿天下志，未忍同草木。\n他时素志遂，人进我则缩。\n来此寄馀生，分此山林福。\n吾心与道俱，出处应可卜。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":7340,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题元子故宅","author":"文有年","text":"漫郎百事皆漫尔，独有溪山认作吾。\n念无一物镇泉石，生怕偃蹇羞吾徒。\n灵武中兴功掩德，天地大义须人扶。\n宁将善颂寓谲谏，百世闻之立懦夫。\n太师劲气形于笔，二美能兼自古无。\n后来衮衮下注脚，识者涪翁次石湖。\n松煤狼藉楮山赭，空谷雷响工传摹。\n徘徊熟玩长太息，世道日与湘流俱。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":7341,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题澹山岩","author":"文有年","text":"为爱溪山来永州，黄茅白苇使人愁。\n驱车遥指崳峰去，峰在潇江最上头。\n江转峰回景奇绝，澹山嵌窦真天设。\n摩挲丹灶酌石泉，髣髴曾游今几劫。\n徵君徵君苦避秦，一秦人又一秦人。\n青山踏破无扃鐍，何地堪逃世上尘。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":7342,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"映山红","author":"文彦博","text":"遂请后。\n愿频醉、石楼溪口。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":7343,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"齐云庵","author":"文洪源","text":"齐云山特立，古刹悬危壁。\n翠竹舞柔风，高峰耸红日。\n龙井冽生寒，冰房清澈骨。\n半空神气怡，恍入群仙窟。\n仰盼天河明，俯濯龙潭碧。\n白云任去留，好鸟时栖息。\n一笑尘世空，此乐复何极。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":7344,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"虞美人","author":"文珏","text":"歌唇乍启尘飞处。\n翠叶轻轻举。\n似通舞态逞妖容。\n嫩条纤丽玉玲珑。\n怯秋风。\n虞姬珠碎兵戈里。\n莫认埋魂地。\n只应遗恨寄芳丛。\n露和清泪湿轻红。\n古今同。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":7345,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"澹山岩","author":"文起传","text":"拭目澹岩景，莺花三月时。\n洞堆钟乳石，林拥梵宫基。\n泉瑩宜烹茗，崖穹好笔诗。\n胜游情未倦，又促解舟维。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":7346,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句","author":"文喜","text":"一向乱云寻不得，几番临水待归来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":7347,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句","author":"文德嵩","text":"九品朝中无势援，五层山下有耕桑。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":7348,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"菊花 其一","author":"方九功","text":"露冷江蘋雁度时，萧萧黄菊满疏篱。\n寒枝带雨开仍艳，晚节凌霜赏未迟。\n移傍小檐承绮席，从观深夜倒金卮。\n摘来冉冉香盈把，共泛西风醉莫辞。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":7349,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"登云岩塔二绝 其一","author":"方万里","text":"湖迥山明玉宇澄，浮图绝顶快高登。\n天风吹我今宵梦，多在瑶台十二层。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":7350,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"登云岩塔二绝 其二","author":"方万里","text":"窣堵崔嵬置曲栏，不知身在碧云端。\n墨题便是慈恩约，只尺联镳上广寒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":7351,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题真源宫","author":"方千里","text":"万岁丹霞府，千函蕊笈书。\n时时瞻绛节，往往下云车。\n近与刚风接，高连上帝居。\n登前望南岳，清跸彻空虚。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":7352,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"一落索 其一","author":"方千里","text":"月影娟娟明秀。\n帘波吹皱。\n徘徊空度可怜宵，谩问道、因谁瘦。\n不见芳音长久。\n鳞鸿空有。\n渭城西路恨依然，尚梦想、青青柳。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":7353,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"一落索 其二","author":"方千里","text":"心抵江莲长苦。\n凌波人去。\n厌厌消瘦不胜衣，恨清泪、多于雨。\n旧曲慵歌琼树。\n谁传香素。\n碧溪流水过楼前，问红叶、来何处。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":7354,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"丁香结","author":"方千里","text":"烟湿高花，雨藏低叶，为谁翠消红陨。\n叹水流波迅。\n抚艳景、尚有轻阴馀润。\n乳莺啼处路，思归意、泪眼暗忍。\n青青榆荚满地，纵买闲愁难尽。\n勾引。\n正记著年时，乍怯春寒阵阵。\n小阁幽窗，残妆剩粉，黛眉曾晕。\n迢递魂梦万里，恨断柔肠寸。\n知何时重见，空为相思瘦损。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":7355,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"三部乐","author":"方千里","text":"帘卷窗明，听杜宇乍啼，漏声初绝。\n乱云收尽，天际□留残月。\n奈相送、行客将归，怅去程渐促，霁色催发。\n断魂别浦，自上孤舟如叶。\n悠悠音信易隔。\n纵怨怀恨语，到见时难说。\n堪嗟水流急景，霜飞华发。\n想家山、路穷望睫。\n空倚仗、魂亲梦切。\n不似嫩朵，犹能替、离绪千结。","collection":"宋","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":7356,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}}]